          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">How we know them</span><span class="info-stat-val">Excavations by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thailand">Thailand</a>’s Fine Arts Department in the 1960s–70s and the 1974–1975 University of Pennsylvania Museum dig; thermoluminescence, radiocarbon and Bayesian dating; study of skeletons and animal bones; the Ban Chiang metals monograph.</span></div>
        </div>
